            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mary was tasked to find the coefficient of ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "x^5",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " in the expansion of ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "(1+x^2)^7",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". She immediately answers 0. How was she able to correctly answer so quickly?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Only even powers of $x$ occur, so there is no $x^5$ term and its coefficient is 0.",
      "worked": "The general term is $T_k=\\binom{7}{k}x^{2k}$, so the powers are $0,2,4,6,\\ldots,14$. None is 5; therefore the coefficient of $x^5$ is 0.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 20
